        "content": "## PID Fan Controller Monitoring Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard provides real-time monitoring of the PID-based fan controller for server temperature management.\n\n### Key Metrics:\n- **Temperature Monitoring**: Shows current vs target temperature\n- **Fan Speed**: Current fan speed percentage and historical trends\n- **PID Integral Term**: Helps with PID tuning and debugging\n- **IPMI Errors**: Tracks communication issues with the BMC\n- **Service Status**: Shows if the controller is running\n\n### Configuration:\n- Target Temperature: Set in `config.ini`\n- PID Parameters (Kp, Ki, Kd): Configured in `config.ini`\n- Scrape Interval: 15 seconds (configured in `prometheus.yml`)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
